msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/api/first-endpoint.rst:13
msgid "Why Auto-Routing?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/api/first-endpoint.rst:15
msgid ""
"The previous tutorial showed how to define routes manually in "
"**app/Config/Routes.php**. While powerful and flexible, this can be "
"tedious for RESTful APIs with many endpoints that follow a common "
"pattern. Auto-Routing simplifies this by mapping URL patterns to "
"controller classes and methods based on conventions, and its focus on "
"HTTP verbs works well for RESTful APIs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/api/first-endpoint.rst:18
msgid "Enable Improved Auto Routing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/api/first-endpoint.rst:20
msgid ""
"By default, Auto-Routing is turned off. Enable it so your controllers "
"automatically handle REST-style methods."
msgstr ""

